      "options": {
        "content": "### Metrics\n\n- CPU package: `node_rapl_package_joules_total` (rate is watts).\n- CPU domains: `node_rapl_core_joules_total`, `node_rapl_uncore_joules_total`.\n- GPU: `node_hwmon_power_average_watt` joined with `node_hwmon_chip_names{chip_name=\"amdgpu\"}`.\n\nRAPL covers the CPU package; hwmon covers the two R9700s. Neither includes PSU, VRM, RAM, fans or board losses. For wall power, use the metered plug/UPS dashboard.",
